          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Dokodemo Hamster 2 (Also known as Doko Demo Hamster 2) is a simulation game that allows the player to breed 3 different hamsters (that are the same ones of the game series). The player can give the hamsters food, show them appreciation and give them a happy life.\n\nThe game is compatible with the Pocketstation controller.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Dokodemo Hamster 2 (también conocido como Doko Demo Hamster 2) es un juego de simulación que permite criar 3 hámsteres diferentes (los mismos de la serie). El jugador puede darles comida, mostrarles aprecio y procurarles una vida feliz.\n\nEl juego es compatible con el controlador Pocketstation.",
